          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni epakupenda abenafyalo bonse abali mu Israeli, ukutula apo wishi Davidi apendele abenafyalo, asanga impendwa bali amakana umwanda umo na makumi yasano na yatatu, ne myanda mutanda (153,600). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asalapo abantu amakana amakumi cine lubali (70,000) ukuba abakutunta ifipe, bambi amakana amakumi cine konse konse (80,000) ukuba abakutoba amabwe mu mpili elyo bambi amakana yatatu ne myanda mutanda (3,600) ababika ukuba bakangalila pali bena pakuti abantu balebomba imilimo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
